{"ref":"BDB, שָׁמִיר","hw":"שָׁמִיר","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁמִיר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.9\">Ez 3:9</a> <strong>thorn(s), adamant, flint</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.6\">Is 5:6</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמִירוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.17\">10:17</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  coll. <em>thorns, thorn-bushes</em>, token of waste-land, only Is, + <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁיִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.6\">Is 5:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.23\">7:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.4\">27:4</a>; fig. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.17\">9:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.17\">10:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹץ שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.13\">32:13</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>adamant</em>, as sharp, <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּתוּבָה</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּצִפֹּרֶן שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.1\">Je 17:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעֵט בַּרְזֶל</span>); as hard, fig. of prophet’s firmness <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.9\">Ez 3:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 7:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.7.12\">Zc 7:12</a> fig. of hard heart.","next":"BDB, שָׁמִיר²","prev":"BDB, שׁמור"}